{
  "info": {
    "name": "Friends on Campus: user, order and credit services",
    "description": "AI Assistance Disclosure: Claude Code (Opus 5.5), 2026-10-18. Scope: Postman collection for the user, order and credit services. Author review: Pending.\n\nRun the user requests first: logging in saves requesterToken, courierToken and adminToken for the other folders. Create order saves orderId. Internal folders use the local shared secrets and Pub/Sub push format.\n\nSet supplierId in the environment (the default is Cool Spot from the supplier seed data) and sagaCommand for Push saga command.",
